[{"id":162389627,"discussion_id":"9093c0e778236e73181f1177a78dd175d8ead62d","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (2/2) | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-05T21:52:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T15:39:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162389643,"discussion_id":"1555663d6e46b6bd5fef7e33628dcf23e5ea7e53","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-05T21:52:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-05T21:52:28+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162389778,"discussion_id":"703d5b47f0302fb17960321d52141d6772b621bc","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR包含两个主要修改。第一，修复了`aclnnRepeatInterleaveTensorGetWorkspaceSize`函数中数据类型转换与张量连续化操作的顺序问题，避免了因内存布局不连续可能引发的计算错误或性能下降。第二，对`SparseToDense`算子进行了性能优化和代码重构，解决了小数据量场景下因过度并行和不必要的全局同步（`syncall`）导致的性能开销问题，并同步更新了算子定义文档。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n针对第一个问题，调整了`aclnnRepeatInterleaveTensorGetWorkspaceSize`函数内部对`repeats`张量的处理流程，确保先执行张量连续化操作，再进行必要的数据类型转换，从而保证输入张量同时具备正确的数据类型和连续的内存布局。\n\n针对第二个问题，对`SparseToDense`算子进行了多维度优化：1）在平铺（Tiling）阶段引入小数据量判断阈值，触发单核执行路径以避免并行开销，并据此设置`isNeedSyncall`标志以跳过不必要的全局同步；2）重构了内核（Kernel）实现，移除冗余参数、优化循环逻辑，并基于上述标志实现条件同步；3）更新了算子Proto定义文档，使其描述更精确；4）同步更新了相关测试用例以适配代码变更。","created_at":"2026-02-05T21:53:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-05T21:53:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162389991,"discussion_id":"eba70484128a0b897c6e60634039adf9ad31a3d0","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n lihang_13123, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-02-05T21:55:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-05T21:55:41+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162389994,"discussion_id":"804b29cfdf82a24868bc4b9e6602e5f162f55262","body":":large_